{"type":"text","timestamp":1794546707797,"sessionID":"ses_e2cb1fb21ffe0SRrGmqNzgsjny","part":{"id":"prt_1d351ab6a001LYCtZeMP5SaZNV","sessionID":"ses_e2cb1fb21ffe0SRrGmqNzgsjny","messageID":"msg_1d3519ddb001AeWeWmScODJIhP","type":"text","text":"T021 complete.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs`\n  - `backfillRunLog` gained `briefOnly = false`. When true it skips the warm-up and the replay, calls only the delivery reader, and writes `{ ...line, briefDelivered, briefBackfilled: true }`, leaving `offeredCommand`, `offeredPolicy`, `offerError` and `offerBackfilled` exactly as the input line holds them (present or absent). The same-path refusal and the prompt lookup still run before any write.\n  - Added the comment: a recorded offer belongs to the head the turn saw, so recomputing delivery must not replay it.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-offer.vitest.ts`\n  - Added one case: a line with `offeredCommand: '/create:readme'` and a line with no offer field pass through `briefOnly: true` with their offer fields unchanged, `briefDelivered` from the injected `brief`, `briefBackfilled: true`, and `warm`/`replay` never called.\n\n**Verify output**\n\n```\n$ env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run tests/command-offer.vitest.ts\n RUN  v4.1.12 /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  19 passed (19)\n```\n\nAlso checked: `node --check scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs` → `exit=0`; `npm run typecheck` → `exit=0`.\n\n**Not done / notes**\n- Nothing blocked. `tasks.md` was not modified (checkbox left unticked).\n- `command-offer.mjs` and its test already carried uncommitted edits from earlier wave tasks (T007/T014); those were preserved, and only the T021 regions were added.","time":{"start":1794546707306,"end":1794546707797}}}
